WEBVTT

00:06:58.296 --> 00:07:01.309
it just moves around
and looks for somebody else,

00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:04.043
because they want so very much to exist.

00:07:04.067 --> 00:07:08.084
CA: So let me put on my skeptical
devil's advocate hat for a minute.

00:07:08.108 --> 00:07:09.268
EG: Yeah.

00:07:09.292 --> 00:07:11.292
CA: Some people will say, "You've lost me.

00:07:11.316 --> 00:07:13.639
You're someone who believes
in the supernatural,

00:07:13.663 --> 00:07:15.402
who believes in this world of magic.

00:07:15.426 --> 00:07:16.748
I'm a down-to-earth person.

00:07:16.772 --> 00:07:20.297
I think the universe is made up
of matter and atoms and electrical forces,

00:07:20.321 --> 00:07:23.248
and all this other stuff
is kind of 'woo' on the outside."

00:07:23.621 --> 00:07:26.456
It seems to me that your advice

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:30.837
can be used even by someone
who believes that view of the world,